OL,5,G0010 Man of the West
OL,6,     FWestern starring Gary Cooper and
OL,7,     FJulie London. A reformed outlaw is
OL,8,     Fforced to return to his old ways
OL,9,     Fwhen a ruthless gang begins
OL,10,     Fterrorising his community. (1958)
OL,11,G0110 Outback Truckers
OL,12,     FOutback legend Steve Grahame is
OL,13,     Fhauling three million dollars'
OL,14,     Fworth of vital power generating
OL,15,     Fequipment to Kalumburu, an
OL,16,     Fisolated community in the far
OL,17,     FNorth West of Australia.
